# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
scripts/__pycache__/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Untracked local scratch (PR drafts, hold-until-release notes,
# maintainer diagnosis notes)
pr-draft-*.md
okf-*-draft.md
ce-*-fix.md
ce-*-note.md

# Developer-side planning docs (plan-assist triad). Session continuity and
# working intent — deliberately local-only. Remote main carries substantive
# code and user-facing docs; what shipped is recorded in CHANGELOG.md.
# Root-anchored so the in-workspace `.curator/log.md` journal and any
# generated bundle log.md are unaffected.
/charter.md
/work-plan.md
/log.md

# JS package workspaces (packages/*)
packages/*/node_modules/
packages/*/dist/
packages/*/test-results/
packages/*/e2e/shots/
packages/*/dist-harness/
